OL,6,GThere are two types of office        W5
OL,7,Gworkers: those who eat lunch al-     W5
OL,8,Gdesko, and those who have to endure  W5
OL,9,Gthe smell of everyone else's.        W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,GFew things are more likely to test   W5
OL,12,Gworkplace relationships than the     W5
OL,13,Gperson sitting next to you proudly   W5
OL,14,Gunveiling a container of reheated    W5
OL,15,Gfish.                                W5
OL,16,                                      W5
OL,17,GFrom tuna sandwiches and boiled eggs W5
OL,18,Gto crumbly and sticky treats that    W5
OL,19,Gleave a mess on the keyboard, what   W5
OL,20,Gis considered OK to eat in the       W5
OL,21,Goffice can be surprisingly divisive. W5
